        "original_id": "0d24c7be-16aa-5eca-a4a2-fb3be6668c78",
        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- People: C. J. Hunter\n- Products: Nandrolone, nandrolone decanoate, nandrolone phenylpropionate\n- Events: 2000 US Olympic Trials\n- Concepts: anabolic–androgenic steroids\n\nFacts:\n- C. J. Hunter threw his personal best of 71' 9\" (21.87 m) during a second-place finish at the 2000 US Olympic Trials.\n- Nandrolone is an injected anabolic–androgenic steroid used medically.\n- Nandrolone is used medically in ester forms including nandrolone decanoate, sold as Deca-Durabolin, and nandrolone phenylpropionate, sold as Durabolin.",
        "type": "TextSummary"
      },
